      "en": "You are to teach the children of Israel all the statutes which the LORD has spoken to them by Moses.”",
      "ko": "또 여호와가 모세로 명한 모든 규례를 이스라엘 자손에게 가르치리라",
      "source_text_hash": "9f85d96b518864dc1b5140f6f1f02409bb3781ef2457726fd0bcf2355bd712da",
      "translation_text_hash": "714c9c1c2e2b73b298fdec2e52d79a58cd4855638719dab42b0d46f9154fb7c0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
