      ],
      "en": "and you shall eat it in a holy place, because it is your portion, and your sons’ portion, of the offerings of the LORD made by fire; for so I am commanded.",
      "ko": "이는 여호와의 화제중 네 응식과 네 아들의 응식인즉 너희는 그것을 거룩한 곳에서 먹으라 내가 명령을 받았느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a18a379df582ad67c7a37881268dfba98e7c93d72534a176678c5d1187899d3a",
      "translation_text_hash": "71c5f0e3c7603efb4c81acb5d218374393e1a93888a9a3d9db382287ddbdb1c5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
