      "en": "Behold, its blood was not brought into the inner part of the sanctuary. You certainly should have eaten it in the sanctuary, as I commanded.”",
      "ko": "그 피를 성소에 들여오지 아니하였으니 그 제육은 너희가 나의 명한 대로 거룩한 곳에서 먹었어야 할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "68f6e33778b2e8d7a4e90b913b5b359a46b8fb5a0f9db0fdf6709a75ba57eea7",
      "translation_text_hash": "489642ad07f3607d3cf17ede857d794b6331ee1d7c2c5dc78a4d7237f230cda0",
